ed-btn\\\\\\\" data-speed\\\\u003d\\\\\\\"2\\\\\\\" tabindex\\\\u003d\\\\\\\"0\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e2x\\\\u003c/button\\\\u003e\\\\n                        \\\\u003c\\\\n```\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,false,true,null,null,[[\\\"Defining core CSS reset and dark theme variables\\\",[1790620209,913138214]],[\\\"Styling header and layout structure\\\",[1790620209,913141317]],[\\\"Styling main workspace and dropzone\\\",[1790620209,913143322]],[\\\"Styling timeline slider and controls toolbar\\\",[1790620209,913145701]],[\\\"Styling speed selector and frames gallery\\\",[1790620209,913147844]],[\\\"Styling live statistics sidebar\\\",[1790620209,913149719]],[\\\"Rendering header section\\\",[1790620209,913151691]],[\\\"Rendering main workspace and sidebar layout\\\",[1790620209,913153919]]]],null,true]],null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\\\"San Carlos, CA, USA\\\",\\\"SWML_DESCRIPTION_FROM_YOUR_INTERNET_ADDRESS\\\",false,null,\\\"//www.google.com/maps/vt/data\\\\u003dDo7xJoV1sTNrlc1_E_QPRwKnqy2qTl5_IL4Fk6ijoI85IXk9nzjeyzhjCsxRS-wtbS_1W37nGPtpGT5KzELog_YVAAYfra3ZBgAQ4_wvNUk1p9SRWVxz4M7FKPlJa76R3ukF3aA0RnjfCLawJsEAqNu2Vrf4XZxS7bATsEe31g_fDaiy3nh_BhvEBeNRpg\\\"],null,null,\\\"US\\\",null,null,null,null,null,false,null,null,null,null,\\\"en\\\",null,null,null,true,[null,[false,false,false],[false,false,false,false,false,false],false],null,[[[[null,[null,0,\\\"I will now generate the complete, zero-dependency, pure vanilla HTML/CSS/JavaScript QuickTime .mov video player and frame extractor web application. It uses only standard system fonts and native CSS styling, ensuring it renders immediately without any external network dependencies or CDN links.\\\",[[94,98,[[null,null,null,null,3]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[\\\"http://googleusercontent.com/immersive_entry_chip/0\\\"],\\\"c_a6ea4d6918c39910_index.html\\\",null,\\\"QuickTime Video Frame Extractor \\\\u0026 Player\\\",null,[179062