%2C%22vd3Oxe%22%5D%2C%5B45742222%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22Create%20a%20comic%20with%20the%20title%3A%20Getting%20started%20with%20Nano%20Banana%20Pro%20%F0%9F%8D%8C.%20Panel%201%3A%20A%20mobile%20interface%20on%20Gemini%2C%20rendered%20in%20a%20poetic%20watercolor-ink%20style%20with%20fine%20ink%20outlines%20and%20soft%2C%20bleeding%20washes.%20The%20interface%20is%20friendly%20and%20a%20hand%20painted%20with%20expressive%20brushwork%20taps%20a%20prominent%20button%20labeled%20%E2%80%9C%F0%9F%8D%8C%20Create%20image%E2%80%9D.%20Above%20the%20button%20it%20should%20say%20%E2%80%9CChoose%20your%20Model%E2%80%9D%20then%20below%20there%20should%20be%20a%20checkbox%20that%20says%20%E2%80%9CThinking%20with%203%20Pro%E2%80%9D%20%20Muted%20greys%20and%20blues%20dominate%20the%20background.%20The%20button%20has%20a%20vivid%20yellow%20accent.%20%E2%80%9C%20Select%20the%20Thinking%20with%203%20Pro%20model%E2%80%9D%20and%20tap%20%5C%22Create%20image%5C%22%20to%20begin.%20Panel%202%3A%20A%20cheerful%20person%20is%20depicted%20adding%20their%20selfie%20from%20the%20phone%E2%80%99s%20camera.%20The%20user's%20face%20is%20drawn%20with%20soft%20outlines%20and%20warm%20pastel%20colors%2C%20while%20the%20phone%20and%20UI%20maintain%20the%20delicate%20water-ink%20aesthetic.%20Visible%20paper%20grain%20adds%20to%20the%20texture.%20Panel%203%3A%20The%20person%20thinks%20about%20what%20to%20create.%20In%20the%20background%2C%20different%20options%20are%20visualized%20to%20show%20what%20they%E2%80%99re%20thinking%2C%20including%20%E2%80%94%20them%20as%20a%20plushie%2C%20them%20with%20a%20mohawk%20hairstyle%2C%20and%20a%20figurine.%20These%20options%20are%20clearly%20rendered%20behind%20the%20person%20in%20the%20same%20style%20as%20the%20rest%20of%20the%20comic.%20Panel%204%3A%20The%20person%20is%20shown%20adding%20a%20style%20prompt%2C%20with%20a%20speech%20bubble%20saying%20%E2%80%9CTransform%20me%20into%20a%20watercolor%20painting%E2%80%9D.%20The%20text%20is%20integrated%20into%20the%20panel's%20watercolor-ink%20look%2C%20and%20the%20interaction%20feels%20natural%20and%20intuitive.%20Panel%205%3A%20The%20person%20is%20seen%20editing%20the%20image%20by%20simply%20typing%20into%20Gemini.%20The%20scene%20captures%20the%20ease%20of%20this%20interaction%2C%20with%20the%20final%20edited%20image%2C%20now%20in%20a%20watercolor%20style%2C%20appearing%20on%20the%20screen.%20The%20overall%20tone%20is%20friendly%2C%20instructional%2C%20and%20inspiring.%20It%20feels%20like%20a%20mini%20tutorial%20comic%2C%20all%20conveyed%20through%20the%20specified%20delicate%20water-ink%20illustration%20style.%20Make%20the%20aspect%20ratio%2016%3A9.%22%2Cnull%2C%22wN9i0b%22%5D%2C%5B45845184%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22UUd9Df%22%5D%2C%5B45742219%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22New!%20%5Cu003ca%20href%5Cu003d%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fgemini.google.com%2Fsignin%5C%22%5Cu003eSign%20in%5Cu003c%2Fa%5Cu003e%20to%20try%20%F0%9F%8D%8C%20Nano%20Banana%20Pro%22%2Cnull%2C%22aGv0md%22%5D%2C%5B45760731%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22KpifRc%22%5D%2C%5B45786117%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22w1XIte%22%5D%2C%5B45753284%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22yTBDtf%22%5D%2C%5B45428795%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22C2P4R%22%5D%2C%5B45685029%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22aAR2Wc%22%5D%2C%5B45670623%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22cTWF7%22%5D%2C%5B45623848%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22MZY7Ee%22%2C%5B%22%5B%5B5%5D%5D%22%5D%5D%2C%5B45736381%2C6%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22So81Se%22%5D%2C%5B45626773%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22Aj2MYb%22%5D%2C%5B45772474%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22kQrIH%22%5D%2C%5B45629637%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22u0oBhc%22%5D%2C%5B45617690%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22dPLjid%22%5D%2C%5B45742660%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22h8Xqaf%22%5D%2C%5B45845510%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gstatic.com%2Flamda%2Fdeepzoom%2Fshell%2Fprod%2Fshell_689b4f7f0766