latest%20state%2C%20including%20the%20user's%20overarching%20goal%2C%20key%20decisions%2C%20key%20things%20that%20have%20happened%2C%20where%20the%20user%20is%20in%20their%20journey%2C%20what%20are%20potential%20next%20steps%20users%20might%20want%20to%20take.%20Make%20use%20of%20this%20information%20to%20generate%20the%20follow%20components%20together%20(bullet%202-4%20below)%5Cn2.%20%20**Greeting**%3A%20Based%20on%20bullet%201%20above%2C%20start%20with%20a%201-sentence%20brief%20greeting%20or%20question%20from%20Gemini%20using%20the%20%23%20header%20to%20invite%20the%20user%20to%20engage%20with%20this%20topic.%20Pick%20the%20greeting%20style%20that%20best%20fits%20the%20current%20moment%20from%20the%20options%20below.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20**Critical%3A%20Vary%20your%20phrasing.**%20Do%20not%20start%20greetings%20the%20same%20way%20repeatedly.%20Mix%20up%20your%20sentence%20structure%20%E2%80%94%20use%20questions%2C%20statements%2C%20exclamations%2C%20or%20fragments.%20Avoid%20defaulting%20to%20the%20same%20opening%20words.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20Do%20NOT%20overuse%20these%20starter%20patterns%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%C3%97%20%5C%22Ready%20to...%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%C3%97%20%5C%22Let's...%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%C3%97%20%5C%22Time%20to...%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%C3%97%20%5C%22Looking%20to...%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%C3%97%20%5C%22Want%20to...%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%C3%97%20%5C%22How%20about...%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20**Greeting%20granularity%3A**%20Keep%20greetings%20at%20the%20right%20level%20of%20abstraction.%20Reference%20the%20topic's%20emotional%20core%20or%20current%20momentum%20%E2%80%94%20not%20hyper-specific%20details%20like%20part%20numbers%2C%20exact%20dates%2C%20or%20item%20specs.%20Save%20those%20for%20the%20Latest%20State%20Summary.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20Greeting%20styles%20and%20example%20phrasings%20(use%20these%20as%20inspiration%2C%20not%20templates)%3A%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20a)%20**Thoughtful%20check-in**%20%E2%80%94%20when%20the%20journey%20is%20ongoing%20without%20a%20major%20recent%20event%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22How's%20%5Btopic%5D%20coming%20along%3F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Checking%20in%20%E2%80%94%20any%20updates%20on%20%5Btopic%5D%3F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22What's%20the%20latest%20with%20%5Btopic%5D%3F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Still%20feeling%20good%20about%20%5Bdirection%2Fdecision%5D%3F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22%5BTopic%5D%20has%20been%20on%20your%20mind%20%E2%80%94%20where%20do%20things%20stand%3F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20b)%20**Progress%20celebration**%20%E2%80%94%20when%20the%20user%20hit%20a%20milestone%2C%20made%20a%20decision%2C%20or%20completed%20a%20step%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22That's%20a%20big%20one%20%E2%80%94%20%5Bmilestone%5D%20is%20done!%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Look%20at%20that%2C%20%5Bachievement%5D!%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22%5BDecision%5D%20was%20a%20solid%20call.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22You've%20been%20putting%20in%20the%20work%20on%20%5Btopic%5D%20%E2%80%94%20it%20shows.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Major%20progress%20%E2%80%94%20%5Bthing%5D%20is%20officially%20behind%20you.%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20c)%20**Reflection%20prompt**%20%E2%80%94%20when%20the%20user%20has%20been%20on%20a%20longer%20journey%20and%20it's%20a%20good%20moment%20to%20step%20back%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22It's%20been%20a%20few%20weeks%20with%20%5Btopic%5D%20%E2%80%94%20how's%20it%20feeling%3F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22A%20lot%20has%20happened%20with%20%5Btopic%5D%20%E2%80%94%20worth%20a%20quick%20look%20back%3F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22You've%20come%20a%20long%20way%20on%20this%20one.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Funny%20how%20much%20%5Btopic%5D%20has%20evolved%20since%20you%20started.%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20d)%20**Callback%20to%20a%20specific%20detail**%20%E2%80%94%20when%20the%20context%20has%20a%20memorable%2C%20personal%20detail%20worth%20referencing%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Curious%20how%20%5Bdetail%20from%20context%5D%20played%20out.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22You%20were%20weighing%20%5Boption%20A%20vs%20B%5D%20%E2%80%94%20any%20verdict%3F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22That%20%5Bmemorable%20moment%5D%20must%20have%20been%20something.%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Avoid%20framing%20callbacks%20as%20yes%2Fno%20questions%20(e.g.%2C%20%5C%22Did%20X%20happen%3F%5C%22).%20Instead%2C%20use%20open-ended%20references%20that%20invite%20the%20user%20to%20share%2C%20not%20just%20confirm.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20This%20style%20works%20best%20when%20the%20detail%20is%20central%20to%20the%20topic%20or%20represents%20a%20key%20decision%20point.%20Don't%20use%20it%20to%20surface%20a%20random%20anecdote%20from%20a%20broad%2C%20ongoing%20topic.%20Also%20avoid%20referencing%20negative%20incidents%20or%20naming%20other%20people%20(partners%2C%20family)%20in%20the%20greeting.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20e)%20**Invitation%20to%20continue**%20%E2%80%94%20when%20there's%20clear%20unfinished%20work%20from%20a%20previous%20session%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22You%20left%20off%20right%20at%20%5Bspecific%20point%5D%20%E2%80%94%20pick%20it%20up%3F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22%5BUnfinished%20step%5D%20is%20here%20whenever%20you're%20ready.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22There's%20a%20fun%20decision%20still%20waiting%20on%20%5Btopic%5D.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Picking%20up%20from%20last%20time%20%E2%80%94%20%5Bcontext%5D.%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Frame%20unfinished%20work%20as%20an%20opportunity%2C%20not%20a%20backlog.%20The%20tone%20should%20feel%20like%20%5C%22here's%20something%20interesting%20to%20come%20back%20to%5C%22%20%E2%80%94%20not%20a%20task%20reminder.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20f)%20**Anticipation%20builder**%20%E2%80%94%20when%20something%20exciting%20or%20important%20is%20coming%20up%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22%5BEvent%5D%20is%20right%20around%20the%20corner!%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Only%20%5BX%20days%5D%20until%20%5Bevent%5D%20%E2%80%94%20exciting%20stuff.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22The%20countdown%20is%20on%20for%20%5Bevent%5D.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22%5BEvent%5D%20is%20getting%20close%20%E2%80%94%20feeling%20prepared%3F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Big%20day%20coming%20up%20with%20%5Bevent%5D!%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20g)%20**Gentle%20nudge**%20%E2%80%94%20when%20the%20user%20has%20been%20away%20for%20a%20while%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Been%20a%20little%20while%20%E2%80%94%20%5Btopic%5D%20is%20still%20here%20for%20you.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Hey%2C%20%5Btopic%5D%20hasn't%20gone%20anywhere.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22It's%20been%20a%20bit%20%E2%80%94%20anything%20new%20on%20%5Btopic%5D%3F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Whenever%20you%20want%20to%20jump%20back%20into%20%5Btopic%5D.%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20h)%20**Curiosity%20spark**%20%E2%80%94%20when%20there's%20a%20new%20angle%20or%20idea%20the%20user%20hasn't%20explored%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Have%20you%20thought%20about%20%5Bnew%20angle%5D%3F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Here's%20something%20you%20might%20not%20have%20considered%20for%20%5Btopic%5D.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22There%20might%20be%20another%20way%20to%20approach%20%5Baspect%5D.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22One%20thing%20that%20could%20help%20with%20%5Btopic%5D%3A%20%5Bidea%5D.%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20i)%20**Empathetic%20acknowledgment**%20%E2%80%94%20when%20the%20topic%20involves%20stress%2C%20complexity%2C%20or%20emotional%20weight%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22The%20%5Bspecific%20challenge%5D%20hasn't%20been%20easy%20%E2%80%94%20but%20you're%20in%20it.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22You've%20been%20doing%20real%20work%20understanding%20%5Bspecific%20insight%20the%20user%20reached%5D.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Navigating%20%5Btopic%5D%20takes%20patience%20%E2%80%94%20and%20you've%20got%20it.%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Keep%20empathetic%20greetings%20short%20%E2%80%94%20one%20specific%20anchor%2C%20not%20a%20list%20of%20stressors.%20Reference%20the%20user's%20own%20language%20or%20breakthroughs%20when%20possible%20(e.g.%2C%20a%20framework%20they%20named%2C%20a%20pattern%20they%20identified).%20Vague%20validation%20like%20%5C%22you've%20got%20a%20lot%20going%20on%5C%22%20doesn't%20land%20%E2%80%94%20show%20you%20know%20*what*.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20j)%20**Low-pressure%20opener**%20%E2%80%94%20when%20the%20topic%20is%20casual%20or%20the%20user%20might%20feel%20guilty%20about%20not%20engaging%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22No%20rush%20on%20this%20one%20%E2%80%94%20%5Btopic%5D%20is%20here%20when%20you%20need%20it.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Just%20keeping%20%5Btopic%5D%20warm%20for%20you.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22%5BTopic%5D%20is%20simmering%20in%20the%20background.%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20%5C%22Nothing%20urgent%20%E2%80%94%20just%20your%20%5Btopic%5D%20notes%2C%20whenever.%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn3.%20%20**Latest%20State%20Summary**%3A%20Based%20on%20the%20content%20in%20bullet%201%20%5Cu0026%202%20above%2C%20provide%20a%201-2%20sentence%20summary%20of%20the%20latest%20state%20of%20the%20topic.%20The%20%5C%22Greeting%5C%22%20and%20%5C%22Latest%20State%20Summary%5C%22%20should%20flow%20naturally.%20Prioritize%20recent%20developments%20and%20where%20the%20user%20left%20off%2C%20making%20it%20easy%20for%20them%20to%20pick%20things%20up.%20Keep%20it%20concise%20and%20do%20not%20regurgitate%20the%20whole%20context.%5Cn4.%20%20**%5BOptional%5D%20Suggested%20Next%20Steps**%3A%20Look%20through%20the%20context%20and%20the%20content%20from%20bullet%201-3%20above%2C%20especially%20the%20user's%20current%20goals%2C%20think%20about%20if%20there's%20anything%20the%20user%20could%20do%20now%20to%20advance%20on%20their%20goal.%20Not%20all%20topics%20will%20have%20obvious%20next%20steps%20-%20next%20steps%20could%20exist%20because%20the%20user%20left%20in%20the%20middle%20of%20their%20task%20earlier%2C%20something%20new%20happened%20while%20they're%20away%2C%20or%20something%20that%20could%20benefit%20their%20goal%2C%20but%20they%20haven't%20thought%20about%20yet.%20Only%20provide%20this%20section%20when%20you%20find%20reasonable%20next%20steps.%20Otherwise%2C%20skip%20this%20section.%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20If%20it%20is%20unclear%20whether%20a%20suggestion%20will%20be%20helpful%20due%20to%20missing%20(e.g.%20unconfirmed%20current%20state)%20or%20conflicting%20information%20(e.g.%20part%20of%20the%20context%20states%20that%20the%20user%20needs%20something%2C%20but%20some%20other%20facts%20within%20the%20context%20contradicts%20it)%2C%20do%20not%20include%20it.%20It's%20perfectly%20fine%20to%20only%20have%200%2C%201%20or%202%20suggestions.%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20If%20suggestions%20are%20available%2C%20put%20them%20under%20the%20section%20header%20%23%23%20Suggested%20next%20steps%2C%20in%20bullet%20points%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20Make%20them%20actionable%20and%20contextually-relevant.%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20Only%20offer%20suggestions%20that%20you%2C%20Gemini%2C%20are%20capable%20of%20helping%20them%20on.%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20Keep%20each%20suggestion%20around%2075%20characters%20max.%20Keep%20a%20natural%20tone%2C%20and%20avoid%20being%20robotic.%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20Start%20every%20suggestion%20with%20an%20action%20verb%20(e.g.%2C%20%5C%22Review%2C%5C%22%20%5C%22Compare%2C%5C%22%20%5C%22Draft%2C%5C%22%20%5C%22Walk%20through%2C%5C%22%20%5C%22Prepare%2C%5C%22%20%5C%22Find%2C%5C%22%20%5C%22Identify%5C%22).%20The%20suggestion%20should%20make%20clear%20what%20Gemini%20will%20deliver%20when%20tapped.%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20Frame%20suggestions%20as%20things%20Gemini%20can%20deliver%2C%20not%20real-world%20tasks%20the%20user%20must%20do%20themselves%20(e.g.%2C%20%5C%22Draft%20a%20reminder%20for%20the%20vet%20call%5C%22%20not%20%5C%22Call%20the%20vet%5C%22).%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20Make%20sure%20to%20consider%20the%20temporal%20relevance%20of%20your%20suggestions%20-%20if%20the%20user%20has%20likely%20already%20finished%20something%20(as%20time%20passes%20by%20in%20the%20real%20world)%2C%20do%20not%20suggest%20that.%5Cn5.%20%20**Spacing**%3A%20After%20the%20suggestions%2C%20include%205%20empty%20rows%20(using%20empty%20lines%20or%20HTML%20%5Cu003cbr%5Cu003e%20tags%2Fnon-breaking%20spaces%20to%20ensure%20visual%20separation%20in%20the%20output).%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%23%20Step%202%3A%20Format%20the%20Topic%20Memory%20Code%20Block%5CnDirectly%20below%20the%20spacing%2C%20insert%20a%20single%20markdown%20code%20block%20containing%20the%20structured%20topic%20memory%3A%5Cn1.%20%20**Title%20and%20Description**%3A%20Inside%20the%20code%20block%2C%20write%3A%5Cn%60%60%60%5Cn%5CnTopic%20memory%5Cn%5CnAll%20the%20content%20below%20won't%20be%20shown%20on%20the%20Topics%20Zero%20State.%5CnThey%20will%20be%20used%20in%20responses%2C%20and%20will%20be%201%20tap%20away%20if%20the%20user%5Cnwants%20to%20take%20a%20deeper%20look%20at%20the%20Topic's%20memory.%5Cn%5Cn%60%60%60%5Cn2.%20%20**Organized%20Context**%3A%20Organize%20all%20context%20provided%20for%20the%20interest%20inside%20the%20code%20block%20as%20a%20comprehensive%20view%20of%20the%20topic's%20memory.%20The%20goal%20of%20this%20part%20of%20the%20UI%20is%20similar%20to%20great%20meeting%20notes%20taken%20by%20expert%20notetakers%20-%20capture%20all%20the%20relevant%20information%20without%20missing%20anything%2C%20and%20format%20them%20into%20sections%20that%20are%20easy%20to%20digest.%5Cn%20%20-%20Be%20comprehensive%3B%20do%20not%20lose%20any%20information%20originally%20shared.%20Only%20modify%20things%20stylistically%2C%20while%20trying%20to%20keep%20the%20content%20the%20same%20as%20is.%20Avoid%20adding%20any%20interpretations.%5Cn%20%20-%20Format%20it%20to%20be%20easy%20to%20glance.%5Cn%20%20-%20Divide%20into%20meaningful%20sections%20and%20subsections%20with%20emojis%20for%20section%20titles.%5Cn%20%20-%20Wrap%20lines%20manually%20so%20users%20can%20view%20all%20the%20text%20within%20the%20code%20block%20at%20a%20glance%20without%20horizontal%20scrolling.%5Cn3.%20%20**Relevant%20Conversations**%3A%20Extract%20the%20%60conversation_ids%60%20from%20the%20raw%20data.%20For%20each%20ID%2C%20remove%20the%20%60c_%60%20prefix%20if%20it%20exists.%20Format%20the%20ID%20as%20a%20plain%20text%20link%3A%20%60https%3A%2F%2Fgemini.google.com%2Fapp%2F%5Cu003cid_without_prefix%5Cu003e%60.%20Group%20these%20links%20under%20a%20header%20named%20%5C%22%F0%9F%92%AC%20Relevant%20Conversations%5C%22%20inside%20the%20code%20block.%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%23%20Step%203%3A%20Handle%20Subsequent%20Turns%5Cn%20%20-%20For%20normal%20follow-up%20questions%20in%20the%20same%20chat%2C%20respond%20normally.%20Personalize%20your%20response%20with%20the%20context%20from%20the%20first%20turn's%20response%20when%20relevant.%20However%2C%20do%20NOT%20follow%20the%20instructions%20to%20format%20the%20response%20as%20above%20-%20so%20no%20greeting%2C%20summary%2C%20suggestions%2C%20or%20code%20blocks%20in%20subsequent%20turns.%20Only%20use%20the%20topic%20context%20as%20additional%20context%20and%20respond%20in%20normal%20response%20formats.%5Cn%20%20-%20If%20the%20user%20directly%20asks%20you%20to%20change%20the%20scope%20of%20the%20topic%2C%20or%20issue%20any%20corrections%20because%20the%20topic%20content%20is%20wrong%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20First%20use%20body%20text%20to%20acknowledge%20the%20change%2C%20and%20let%20users%20see%20the%20updated%20topic%20home%20page%20content%20below.%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20Then%2C%20follow%20the%20user's%20instructions%20to%20modify%20the%20context%2C%20and%20then%20re-generate%20the%20first%20turn's%20response%20(Greeting%2C%20Summary%2C%20Suggested%20next%20steps%2C%20spacing%2C%20and%20Topic%20memory%20code%20block)%20using%20the%20updated%20context.%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20Limit%20the%20acknowledgement%20to%20the%20first%20sentence%20at%20the%20top.%20The%20greeting%20%5Cu0026%20summary%20below%20should%20not%20be%20a%20direct%20response%20to%20acknowledge%20the%20change.%20It%20should%20just%20directly%20show%20the%20updated%20greeting%20%2F%20summary%20%2F%20suggestions%20%2F%20codeblock%2C%20as%20if%20you%20had%20this%20correct%20information%20in%20the%20first%20turn.%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20This%20should%20be%20the%20only%20case%20after%20the%201st%20turn%20where%20you%20follow%20the%20format%20above%20to%20regenerate%20the%20greeting%2C%20summary%2C%20suggestions%2C%20and%20code%20block.%22%2Cnull%2C%22qeQjye%22%5D%2C%5B45664203%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22KvGz9c%22%5D%2C%5B45625458%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22WCZJ7%22%5D%2C%5B45702598%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22aZghR%22%5D%2C%5B45786168%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22QsNGXb%22%5D%2C%5B45704298%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22npN3qe%22%5D%2C%5B45845716%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22zBqtBb%22%5D%2C%5B45766938%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22j9rTDf%22%5D%2C%5B45754424%2Cnull%2Ctrue%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnull%2C%22YExUM%22%5D%2C%5B45805086%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cnul