Pro%E2%80%9D%20%20Muted%20greys%20and%20blues%20dominate%20the%20background.%20The%20button%20has%20a%20vivid%20yellow%20accent.%20%E2%80%9C%20Select%20the%20Thinking%20with%203%20Pro%20model%E2%80%9D%20and%20tap%20%5C%22Create%20image%5C%22%20to%20begin.%20Panel%202%3A%20A%20cheerful%20person%20is%20depicted%20adding%20their%20selfie%20from%20the%20phone%E2%80%99s%20camera.%20The%20user's%20face%20is%20drawn%20with%20soft%20outlines%20and%20warm%20pastel%20colors%2C%20while%20the%20phone%20and%20UI%20maintain%20the%20delicate%20water-ink%20aesthetic.%20Visible%20paper%20grain%20adds%20to%20the%20texture.%20Panel%203%3A%20The%20person%20thinks%20about%20what%20to%20create.%20In%20the%20background%2C%20different%20options%20are%20visualized%20to%20show%20what%20they%E2%80%99re%20thinking%2C%20including%20%E2%80%94%20them%20as%20a%20plushie%2C%20them%20with%20a%20mohawk%20hairstyle%2C%20and%20a%20figurine.%20These%20options%20are%20clearly%20rendered%20behind%20the%20person%20in%20the%20same%20style%20as%20the%20rest%20of%20the%20comic.%20Panel%204%3A%20The%20person%20is%20shown%20adding%20a%20style%20prompt%2C%20with%20a%20speech%20bubble%20saying%20%E2%80%9CTransform%20me%20into%20a%20watercolor%20painting%E2%80%9D.%20The%20text%20is%20integrated%20into%20the%20panel's%20watercolor-ink%20look%2C%20and%20the%20interaction%20feels%20natural%20and%20intuitive.%20Panel%205%3A%20The%20person%20is%20seen%20editing%20the%20image%20by%20simply%20typing%20into%20Gemini.%20The%20scene%20captures%20the%20ease%20of%20this%20interaction%2C%20with%20the%20final%20edited%20image%2C%20now%20in%20a%20watercolor%20style%2C%20appearing%20on%20the%20screen.%20The%20overall%20tone%20is%20friendly%2C%20instructional%2C%20and%20inspiring.%20It%20feels%20like%20a%20mini%20tutorial%20comic%2C%20all%20conveyed%20through%20the%20specified%20delicate%20water-ink%20illustration%20style.%20Make%20the%20aspect%20ratio%2016%3A9.%22%2Cnull%2C%22wN9i0b%22%5D%2C%5B45845184%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%2Cnul